    "title": "Golden Corral Shut Down After Health Inspectors Discover Roach Infestation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Patrick Herron ,\n4 hours ago Golden Corral in Waldorf, MD has been temporarily closed after health inspectors discovered a roach infestation at the restaurant, located at 2800 Crain Highway in Charles County. According to The BayNet, the Charles County Department of Health suspended the restaurant’s food service license on Tuesday, October 20, following an inspection... Read full article\n3",
